  ('article-zcbwxdrc', 'feed-techcrunch', 'TechCrunch', 'A roadmap for AI, if anyone will listen', 'https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/07/a-roadmap-for-ai-if-anyone-will-listen/', 'Technology', '2026-03-08T06:05:26.000Z'::timestamptz, '2026-03-08T15:11:45.441Z'::timestamptz, 'The Pro-Human Declaration was finalized before last week''s Pentagon-Anthropic standoff, but the collision of the two events wasn’t lost on anyone involved.', 'The Pro-Human Declaration was finalized before last week''s Pentagon-Anthropic standoff, but the collision of the two events wasn’t lost on anyone involved.')
